put b19label, b19copy in b19head
b19block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b19head, b19 in b19block
when b19copy is clicked
    copy text of b19 to clipboard
    text of b19copy is "Copied"
.

docsMain is a column with spacing 16, flex 1, padding "40px 56px 24px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; min-width: 0; max-width: 940px;"
put b1, b2, b3, b4, b5block, b6, b7, b8block, b9, b10block, b11, b12, b13, b14, b15, b16block, b17, b18, b19block in docsMain
docsBody is a row with align top, spacing 0, width full, customstyle "align-items: stretch;"
put docsSidebar, docsMain in docsBody

put topBar, docsBody, siteFooter in app
show app
